<title>USA: ST PAUL CATTLE TRADE STEADY - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST PAUL CATTLE TRADE STEADY - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Tuesday, slaughter</p>
<p>steers and heifers sold fully steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1075-1450 lbs 63.00-64.50, load</p>
<p>high dressing 65.50. Select and choice 2-3 1050-1450 lbs</p>
<p>62.00-63.50. Select 2-3 1125-1350 lbs 58.00-62.75.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4 950-1385 lbs 62.00-63.90.</p>
<p>Select and Choice 2-3 1000-1350 lbs 60.00-62.00.</p>
</text>
